\", \"2026-09-22T16:40Z\"], \"limit\": 50}}]}, {\"role\": \"tool\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"tool_call_response\", \"id\": \"toolu_04\", \"response\": {\"deploy_id\": 4127, \"files\": [\"cart/tax.py\"], \"summary\": \"Tax is now recalculated per line item via tax-service (one HTTP call per item) instead of once per cart.\"}}]}, {\"role\": \"tool\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"tool_call_response\", \"id\": \"toolu_05\", \"response\": {\"matched\": 50, \"median_duration_ms\": 1790, \"top_span\": \"tax-service POST /calculate\", \"calls_per_checkout_p50\": 14}}]}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"[cost-estimator] 281 excess abandoned checkouts; excess cart value EUR 23,180. The EUR to USD conversion failed (historical FX not enabled), so the figure is reported in EUR.\"}]}]"
